      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那些四格漫画的题材很广泛，\n包含比赛到日常生活，\n纪录了真弓快车的各种面向。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbcdd8ef2544362fdcf1fbb496b8c1ec8c80fbaf6c200713e40e4208f714bbbe",
